{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgBz5YoK5n4XdHnQUUJdT","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"MATERIAL OBJECTION\n\n## (1) Fidelity\n\n| Change | Verdict |\n|---|---|\n| 1. Revert edit 3 | **Faithful.** The numerator line is deleted, and P2's `집계에는 역할, 분자, 분모…` stays. |\n| 2. Attribution per claim | **Faithful.** The rule is per claim, keeps the received document as the source, adds `X에 실렸다고 전함`, and keeps scope qualifiers. |\n| 3. Role strings verbatim | **Faithful.** It covers summary columns, legends and aggregates. |\n| 4. Repeated access explanations and counts | **Faithful.** The single ① location, no separate failure list, ④ referring to ①, and no counts or status codes are all present. |\n| 5. Length cut | **Two distortions.** See (a) and (b). |\n\n**(a)** The diff has `도구가 요구하는 출처 목록은 ⑤의 출처 목록으로 갈음하며 따로 만들지 않는다.` DOCUMENT 1 says \"P4 therefore does not forbid it.\" The diff does forbid it, which sets the prompt against a tool reminder repeated 13 times in one run. Replace with:\n> 도구가 요구하는 출처 목록은 ⑤의 출처 목록으로 갈음한다.\n\n**(b)** The new ⑤ line silently drops `검증·상충 기록`. The declared redefinition only removes restated body content and excluded or deferred lists. Conflicts that appear only in the appendix would now have nowhere to go, even though the unchanged rule `누락과 상충을 숨기지 않는다` still applies. Auditors need these records to judge spurious conflicts. Replace the first clause with:\n> ⑤ 근거 부록: 출처 목록(출처마다 한 줄: ID, 마크다운 하이퍼링크, 작성자·매체, 날짜), 본문에 없는 위치·발췌·상충 기록, 크레딧 대조에서 차이가 난 트랙의 행 전체(6의 규칙대로).\n\n## (2) Scope creep and album-specific content\n\n- Nothing beyond (b) falls outside the declared list.\n- No album-specific outlet, service or fact is named. \"부클릿·유통사·판매처\" is unchanged generic text.\n\n## (3) New defects\n\n**(c)** `중단 이유는 확인한 자료의 이름으로 적는다.` is a new recording duty. P3 never asked for stopped branches to be written down at all, so this adds a record for every stopped branch. It names no location, which conflicts with `한 곳에만 적고`, and it invites the same ritual repetition that change 4 is meant to remove. Replace that sentence with:\n> 중단한 가지는 결과를 바꾸는 공백일 때만 ④에 적고, 횟수 대신 확인한 자료의 이름을 쓴다.\n\nThis keeps the declared intent (materials named, not counts) and puts it under the existing ④ rule.\n\n**(d)** The cut order's first target, `⑤의 발췌`, could also remove the position that is an auditor's only anchor for a relayed-quote attribution, which is the D5 check. Replace with:\n> 길이를 넘기면 ⑤의 발췌(위치는 남긴다), ②의 한계 서술, ④ 순으로 줄인다. ③ 전곡 점검표와 크레딧 역할 문자열은 줄이지 않는다.\n\n**No new defect found in the other edits:**\n- The attribution rule cannot lift a relayed quote into direct attribution.\n- The verbatim-role rule agrees with `작사·작곡…합치지 않는다` and with the rules on selective transcription.\n- Dropping `경유 경로` from §4 A is covered, because the route is now recorded per claim in §4 B.\n- `원어 그대로` can be followed in a headless run.\n\nOnce (a) through (d) are applied, I would confirm the freeze.\n\nOut of scope: whether a fixed 6,000-character cap can sit below the 1.10× P0 bar is for the owner to decide."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":10966,"cache_read_input_tokens":1807,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":10966},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"da46a9f5-97fe-462a-a710-2122e3d41ab0","uuid":"9277b8f6-4bb4-491f-89c8-9a990b82eeea","timestamp":"2026-10-19T17:25:06.312Z","request_id":"req_011CgBz5YaRQF1ubXFiPLPiM"}
